//RS // Host-crate projection of the native devtools registry. Compiled consumers
//RS // (`jet_foundation::Devtools::*`) reach the registry through this include and
//RS // these always-on wrappers. Codegen strips this whole region when it splices
//RS // `Prelude/Devtools.rs` (a symlink to this file) into a generated program:
//RS // the program receives `DevtoolsNative.rs` as its own Prelude part exactly
//RS // once and wrappers gated on `JET_DEVTOOLS_RUNTIME_ENABLED` instead.
//RS include!("DevtoolsNative.rs");
